# Template for the ccdapi / ccrapi API keys file. Contains no real values.
#
# Copy to ~/.config/ccst/api-keys (or the path in CCST_API_KEYS_FILE) and chmod 600.
# Do not put this file under ~/.claude and do not source it from a shell rc file:
# ccdapi / ccrapi parse it themselves.
#
# Format: one "label=key" per line; blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# work=sk-ant-api03-REPLACE-ME
